ler's fallacy", "marks": [{"type": "italic"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Predicting random events from the past: believing something that happened often will now happen less, or the reverse, to \"balance\" things."}]}]}}, "index": "a9bfj", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 883.0939226519338, "y": 707, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch12-3r", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch12-36", "props": {"w": 460.9060773480663, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "grey", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Investors who have "}, {"type": "text", "text": "adequately diversified", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " across asset classes"}]}]}}, "index": "aLKdb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 1206, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch12-54", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch12-4n", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "14.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Systematic: market, inflation, exchange rate, interest rate, reinvestment. Unsystematic: credit, business, liquidity."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 24, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aHLi2", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 384, "y": 222, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch12-4s", "type": "note", "parentId": "shape:ch12-4n", "props": {"color": "orange", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2.", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Simple (holding period) return ignores time; simple annualising ignores compounding."}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 1.52, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "a5fIb", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 6160, "y": 20, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch12-5t", "type": "note", "parentId": "page:page", "props": {"color": "light-green", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ANALOGY", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "An everyday picture of the idea"}]}]}, "size": "s", "font": "draw", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "labelColor": "black", "growY": 0, "fontSizeAdjustment": 1, "url": "", "scale": 2.2, "textLastEditedBy": null}, "index": "aDlgz", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 56, "y": 733, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch12-11", "type": "geo", "parentId": "shape:ch12-p", "props": {"w": 128.31168831168833, "h": 102, "geo": "rectangle", "dash": "solid", "growY": 0, "url": "", "scale": 1, "flipX": false, "flipY": false, "color": "blue", "labelColor": "black", "fill": "solid", "size": "s", "font": "sans", "align": "start", "verticalAlign": "start", "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Interest rate", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}]}]}}, "index": "aCfSA", "typeName": "shape"}, {"x": 216, "y": 60, "rotation": 0, "isLocked": false, "opacity": 1, "meta": {}, "id": "shape:ch12-22", "type": "text", "parentId": "shape:ch12-20", "props": {"color": "black", "size": "xl", "w": 940, "font": "draw", "textAlign": "start", "autoSize": false, "scale": 1.2, "richText": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"t